\u2019ll craft a word to form your path. Choose between rooms that strengthen your arsenal, restore your health, or twist your Magick rerolls. You can have it all\u2026 if your vocabulary is sharp enough to forge it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a floor and your letters hum with Magicks. Create tactical combinations by mixing Magicks that should probably never interact. They obey peculiar rules, and mastering them is half the fun.\u00a0 One might strike harder if placed at the end of a word, another might heal you, and a third might hurt you simply for using too many vowels. The most cursed can become your greatest weapon\u2026 if you\u2019re clever or desperate enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend, you\u2019ll acquire new Magicks, whether you want to or not, slowly turning your keyboard into a deck of magnificent, uncontrollable chaos. It\u2019s not just your loadout; it\u2019s your spellbook, your weapon rack, and your greatest liability.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/extras/0c2dccbedca3b8102f841385d9d3c7dd.poster.avif?t=1771869589\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/extras/0c2dccbedca3b8102f841385d9d3c7dd.webm?t=1771869589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/extras/0c2dccbedca3b8102f841385d9d3c7dd.mp4?t=1771869589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success isn\u2019t a big vocabulary, it\u2019s <strong>tactical combinations:</strong> sequencing the right letters, at the right time, in the right word.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/extras/67a2965b90ac8460bcd3ec5f9a2bf5a2.avif?t=1771869589\" width=780 height=80 /></span><strong> </strong><br><br>The Tomb crawls with cursed beasts, deceitful specters, and entities best left unspoken. Each foe is handcrafted with unique mechanics that demand clever thinking and precise wordplay to overcome. Use every ounce of your tactical and verbal acumen to overcome their dastardly tricks!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/extras/708aa4d53378a403335e93178bbf0f6f.apng?t=1771869589\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/extras/708aa4d53378a403335e93178bbf0f6f.poster.avif?t=1771869589\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim the Bloodletter\u2014or else it shall spell your doom.</strong>\u00a0</p>","developers":["Ethan's Secretions"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531630/0fd268f8649d3b5ce7f32fd08234d1e524c2fccd/header.jpg?t=1771869589","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Ethan's Secretions & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531630/2140036199/ba919f0720a9761e5a17786d90819af153065a2d/1771868771/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771869587","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531630/2140036199/ba919f0720a9761e5a17786d90819af153065a2d/1771868771/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771869587","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531630/2140036199/ba919f0720a9761e5a17786d90819af153065a2d/1771868771/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771869587","id":257293027,"name":"Out No